  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien neo-soul in the loose, behind-the-beat style. Rhodes electric piano playing extended seventh and ninth chords with a slow tremolo; dusty drums with a lazy swung hi-hat and a soft rimshot; a round finger-style electric bass sliding between chord tones; muted nylon-string guitar fills between the vocal lines. Intimate late-night mix, warm tape saturation, small room reverb, everything close. A warm male tenor sung close to the mic, conversational in the verses, rising to a soft falsetto on the hook. 84 BPM, Eb major. Tender, patient and quietly amused. No trap hi-hats, no autotune, no EDM build, no rap verse, no big gospel choir.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n十點半 鐵門拉落來\n你穿高踏鞋 轉來到厝\n規工徛佇 化妝品櫃台\n笑甲喙顊 攏硬去矣\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我早就煮好 一鼎薑母水\n倒落面桶 燒甲咧衝煙\n\n[Chorus]\n來 跤囥落來 慢慢仔浸\n燒水淹過 你的跤目\n十二點鐘 徛甲無歇\n這馬換我 跍佇你面前\n\n[Verse]\n你講今仔日 賣出三罐\n有一个阿姨 試色試一點鐘\n我共你的跤 捧佇手內\n腫甲 若兩粒饅頭\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n你喝燒 我閣倒一屑仔冷水\n你笑我 比你閣較驚燒\n\n[Chorus]\n來 跤囥落來 慢慢仔浸\n燒水淹過 你的跤目\n你的頭殼 倚佇沙發\n目睭瞌咧 喙角咧笑\n\n[Bridge]\n毛巾烘燒 一跤一跤拭\n跤指頭仔 紅紅軟軟\n明仔載 閣愛徛十二點鐘\n\n[Chorus]\n來 跤囥落來 慢慢仔浸\n燒水冷去 我閣添\n你若問我 敢袂厭\n你轉來 我就有燒水\n\n[Outro]\n面桶洗清氣 明仔暗閣煮",
